msgid ""
"这些高速参数固定 HSI 名义 16 MHz、AHB 除 1，关闭 CSS，并声明 2.7–3.6 V 供电 范围；维护参考使用 3.3 "
"V、ADC 除 4，其他合法 ADC 分频仍由同一 ClockPlan 校验。 ADC 域只表示计划算术，不授予 ADC "
"provider／模拟供电资格。主 PLL 作为 SYSCLK 源启用，Q 产生名义 48 MHz；该频率 不证明 HSI 温漂或 USB "
"精度，内置 USB PHY 仍要求已审外部 HSE 晶振。"
msgstr ""
"These high-speed parameters fix the nominal HSI input at 16 MHz and the "
"AHB divider at 1, disable CSS and declare a 2.7–3.6 V supply range. The "
"maintained references use 3.3 V and an ADC divider of 4; the same "
"ClockPlan validates other legal ADC dividers. The ADC domain describes "
"clock-plan arithmetic only and grants neither ADC provider support nor "
"analog-supply qualification. The main PLL is enabled as the SYSCLK "
"source, with Q producing a nominal 48 MHz. That frequency does not "
"establish HSI temperature-drift bounds or USB accuracy; an internal USB "
"PHY still requires a reviewed external HSE crystal."

msgid ""
"F446 的 PLLSAI 具有独立 M，所选 SAI1／2 master 可共用一个 Q 计划。F479 的 PLLSAI 与主 PLL 共用 "
"source/M；选择 M10/N210 的主 PLL 后，可另行声明 PLLSAI M10/N192、Q5/post5 得到 12.288 "
"MHz，R4/post16 得到 4.8 MHz。 单个 System owner 保存、设置、回读并撤回所选 Q／R 及 mux；音频／显示 "
"owner 只消费自己的时钟。未选消费者不能留下辅助输出，不能由示例频率推断实际音频误差、 面板或外部存储时序。"
msgstr ""
"F446 PLLSAI has an independent M; the selected SAI1/2 masters can share "
"one Q plan. F479 PLLSAI shares source/M with the main PLL. With main PLL "
"M10/N210 selected, an explicitly declared PLLSAI M10/N192 can produce "
"12.288 MHz through Q5/post5 and 4.8 MHz through R4/post16. One System "
"owner saves, configures, reads back and withdraws the selected Q/R "
"outputs and muxes; audio/display owners only consume their respective "
"clocks. An auxiliary output requires its explicitly selected consumer. "
"Example frequencies do not establish actual audio error, panel timing or "
"external-memory timing."

msgid ""
"冷启动在主 PLL 关闭时设置 VOS scale 1，先建立并读回 Flash latency 与 `PRFTEN`，再等待 "
"`PLLRDY`。F411／F446／F479 的双位 VOS 在 PLL 开启后才生效； C 继续有界等待 `VOSRDY`，观察就绪后才切换 "
"PLL SYSCLK 并建立 TIM2 时间域。 这些顺序来自 RM0383／RM0390／RM0386 的 "
"`PWR_CR.VOS`、`PWR_CSR.VOSRDY` 与 Flash/RCC 合同；锁定 HAL PWREx 也保留 PLL 开启后等待 "
"VOS 的顺序。bootstrap 尚无单调时间，因此使用每阶段 poll 上限，不调用依赖 TIM2 的 HAL tick 等待。"
msgstr ""
"Cold startup sets VOS scale 1 while the main PLL is disabled, establishes"
" and reads back Flash latency and `PRFTEN`, then waits for `PLLRDY`. The "
"two-bit VOS setting on F411/F446/F479 takes effect only after the PLL is "
"enabled. C therefore performs an additional bounded wait for `VOSRDY`; "
"only after readiness is observed does it select PLL SYSCLK and establish "
"the TIM2 time domain. This sequence follows the `PWR_CR.VOS`, "
"`PWR_CSR.VOSRDY` and Flash/RCC contracts in RM0383/RM0390/RM0386. The "
"locked HAL PWREx also waits for VOS after enabling the PLL. Bootstrap has"
" no monotonic time yet, so it uses a poll limit for each phase rather "
"than HAL tick waits that depend on TIM2."

msgid ""
"外来 overdrive 位，以及与所选 prefetch 冲突的 `ADCDC1` 位，在可读冷态准入时拒绝； 前者适用于 "
"F446／F479，后者适用于这三种新料号。若 PWR gate 原先关闭， 取得并读回 gate 后再次检查，不靠 gated MMIO "
"零值推定没有 owner。就绪失败不发布 有效时间域；退出先观察 HSI/SWS，再撤主／辅助 PLL 并恢复本 owner 的快照。退出 "
"失败保留原责任与存储，只有真实成功重试才能回收，不把超时包装成已撤回。"
msgstr ""
"Foreign overdrive bits and an `ADCDC1` setting that conflicts with the "
"selected prefetch mode are rejected during cold admission when the "
"register is readable. The former applies to F446/F479 and the latter to "
"all three new parts. If the PWR gate was disabled, the owner acquires and"
" reads back the gate before checking again; a zero read from gated MMIO "
"is never taken as proof that no owner exists. Readiness failure does not "
"publish a valid time domain. Withdrawal first observes HSI/SWS, then "
"withdraws the main/auxiliary PLLs and restores this owner's snapshots. "
"Failed withdrawal retains the original responsibility and storage; "
"reclamation requires an actually successful retry. A timeout is never "
"reported as completed withdrawal."

msgid ""
"这些策略只授权直接 HSI16 与列出的高速元组，不包含运行期 DVFS、F411 100 MHz 或 F446／F479 180 MHz "
"overdrive。180 MHz 的主 PLL Q 不能整数产生 48 MHz， 不能仅改 SYSCLK 数值继续复用本模式的 CLK48 "
"合同。新料号低功耗经过下述独立 资源、寄存器和勘误审查；System restart／restore 单项结果不替代完整深睡眠路径 或实板验收。"
msgstr ""
"These policies authorize only direct HSI16 and the listed high-speed "
"tuples; they do not include runtime DVFS, F411 at 100 MHz or F446/F479 at"
" 180 MHz with overdrive. At 180 MHz, the main PLL Q cannot produce an "
"integer 48 MHz, so changing only the SYSCLK value cannot preserve this "
"mode's CLK48 contract. Low power on the new parts has undergone the "
"separate resource, register and errata review below; an individual System"
" restart/restore result does not replace the complete deep-sleep path or "
"physical-board acceptance."

msgid "冷启动与内存域"
msgstr "Cold startup and memory domains"

msgid "`SystemInit` 在普通 DATA/BSS 之前启用并读回 CP10/CP11，拒绝继承的有效 MPU， 安装 512-byte 对齐的真实 Flash vector，并保持既有 lazy-FP ABI。它不清除外来 RCC 状态来掩盖 warm handoff；普通启动的只读 preflight 仍要求可证明的冷时钟、 独占 TIM2、正确 FPU/MPU/vector。RAM 尚不可用的失败路径仅使用 reset stack 与 Flash 常量并 park，不依赖日志、scheduler 或 libc。"
msgstr "Before ordinary DATA/BSS initialization, `SystemInit` enables and reads back CP10/CP11, rejects an inherited active MPU, installs the actual 512-byte-aligned Flash vector and preserves the existing lazy-FP ABI. It does not clear foreign RCC state to conceal a warm handoff. The ordinary read-only startup preflight still requires provable cold clocks, exclusive TIM2 and correct FPU/MPU/vector state. Failure before RAM is usable relies only on the reset stack and Flash constants, then parks; it does not depend on logging, a scheduler or libc."

msgid "普通 Platform 在取得引脚与时钟前读取实际 Flash 密度与完整 `DBGMCU_IDCODE`。 DEV_ID 必须为 `0x413`，REV_ID 只接纳已审的 `0x1001`、`0x1003`、`0x1007`、 `0x100F`、`0x101F`；未知、缺失及旧 A 标识不按“更新芯片”自动准入。 DEV／密度不符返回 IO，未审 cut 返回 UNSUPPORTED，均不建立平台资源责任。 同一纯只读 C 规则也用于 pre-C 外部 SRAM bootstrap 和受控镜像 handoff： 前者在不可撤销内存／FSMC 设置前拒绝并 park，后者在最终转移前拒绝。 订货号、封装与 PCB 仍由 Board／实物核对；资料白名单和主机模型不表示开发环境 已经观察到某块实板，也不建立物理资格。"
msgstr "Before acquiring pads or clocks, ordinary Platform reads the actual Flash density and complete `DBGMCU_IDCODE`. DEV_ID must be `0x413`; only reviewed REV_ID values `0x1001`, `0x1003`, `0x1007`, `0x100F` and `0x101F` are admitted. Unknown, missing and legacy A identities do not inherit compatibility as newer silicon. A device/density mismatch returns IO; an unreviewed cut returns UNSUPPORTED. Neither establishes Platform resource responsibility. The same pure read-only C rule also guards pre-C external SRAM bootstrap and controlled image handoff. Bootstrap rejects and parks before irreversible memory/FSMC setup; handoff rejects before the final transfer. Orderable part, package and PCB still require Board/physical inspection. The documented allowlist and host models do not mean that the development environment has observed a physical board or established physical qualification."

msgid "域"
msgstr "Domain"

msgid "F407VE／ZG 事实与使用边界"
msgstr "F407VE/ZG facts and usage boundaries"

msgid "主 SRAM"
msgstr "Main SRAM"

msgid "128 KiB；普通栈、DATA/BSS，已审 DMA 可以访问"
msgstr "128 KiB; ordinary stacks and DATA/BSS, accessible to reviewed DMA"

msgid "CCM"
msgstr "CCM"

msgid "64 KiB CPU-only；显式 linker/startup 计划，DMA 始终排除"
msgstr "64 KiB, CPU-only; explicit linker/startup plan, always excluded from DMA"

msgid "Backup SRAM"
msgstr "Backup SRAM"

msgid "4 KiB；RTC/backup owner 显式获得 gate、DBP/BRE 和借用"
msgstr "4 KiB; the RTC/backup owner explicitly acquires its gate, DBP/BRE and loans"

msgid "外部 SRAM"
msgstr "External SRAM"

msgid "独立精确 FSMC startup plan；不自动获得 STOP 改时钟资格"
msgstr "An independent exact FSMC startup plan; no automatic qualification for STOP clock changes"

msgid "Flash"
msgstr "Flash"

msgid "VE 512 KiB／ZG 1 MiB；不隐含产品分区"
msgstr "VE 512 KiB / ZG 1 MiB; no implied product partitions"

msgid "所选 CCM 在第一次写入前先确认 gate 和完整 copy/clear 计划；默认不增加 CCM 初始化。`.noinit` 仅表示不复制和清零。STOP 保持主 SRAM/CCM 内容，Standby 复位并丢失这两域；backup 的有效性、供电和物理保留由显式 RTC/产品策略证明。"
msgstr "Selected CCM checks its gate and complete copy/clear plan before the first write; the default adds no CCM initialization. `.noinit` means only that copying and zeroing are omitted. STOP preserves main SRAM/CCM contents. Standby resets and loses both domains. Explicit RTC/product policy must establish backup validity, supply and physical retention."

msgid "STOP、Standby 与时间域"
msgstr "STOP, Standby and time domains"

msgid ""
"浅 Sleep 保留运行时钟、TIM2 和现有 tickless 合同。深 STOP 通过可选 "
"`nexus_add_stm32f4_sleep()` 的 `nx_stm32_power_enter` 显式执行。 调用者先关闭自己的 "
"ClockDomain，加入所有设备、DMA、deadline 和 OS borrowers， 实际停止周期 SysTick 并处理其旧 "
"pending。接口验证 closed/empty barrier、全 DMA stream、外设 gate、无 active handler "
"和精确已使能 wake IRQ 集合后才发生效果。"
msgstr ""
"Shallow Sleep retains the running clocks, TIM2 and the existing tickless "
"contract. Deep STOP is performed explicitly through "
"`nx_stm32_power_enter` from the optional `nexus_add_stm32f4_sleep()`. The"
" caller first closes its ClockDomain, joins all device, DMA, deadline and"
" OS borrowers, actually stops periodic SysTick and handles its old "
"pending state. The interface takes effect only after validating the "
"closed/empty barrier, every DMA stream, peripheral gates, the absence of "
"active handlers and the exact set of enabled wake IRQs."

msgid "实际装配先调用 `nx_platform_suspend()` 排空 controller 并释放共享 pins/gates， 保留 System；失败停在原有 prefix，必须继续 service/drain 后重试。成功后再关闭 调用者的 ClockDomain barrier、执行 power enter，并在 RUN 恢复后调用 `nx_platform_resume()` 重建同一静态装配。resume 不调用 system_start、不启动 任务、不重放旧请求；失败反向排空，保留 System 和未关闭 owner。尚在挂起状态时 普通 platform stop 拒绝，须先显式恢复。RTC 使用专用 suspend/resume 保存自主 calendar、aux wake route 与持久 backup effects；活动 AlarmA/内存 loan 会阻止挂起。 不可撤回的 watchdog 或 startup SRAM owner 仍可以明确阻止 STOP。"
msgstr "An actual assembly first calls `nx_platform_suspend()` to drain controllers and release shared pins/gates while retaining System. Failure keeps the original prefix; service/drain must progress before retry. After successful suspend, the caller closes its ClockDomain barrier, enters power and calls `nx_platform_resume()` after RUN restoration to rebuild the same static assembly. Resume does not call system_start, start tasks or replay requests. Failure unwinds in reverse order while retaining System and unclosed owners. Ordinary platform stop rejects a still-suspended assembly; explicit resume must happen first. RTC uses dedicated suspend/resume to preserve its autonomous calendar, auxiliary wake route and persistent backup effects. Active AlarmA or memory loans block suspend. An irreversible watchdog or startup SRAM owner can still explicitly block STOP."

msgid "必须先让完整 Platform suspend 成功，再进入原始 Power 入口；只读到外设 gate 为零 不能证明逻辑借用已经退出。例如 OTG 正在 OFF 状态等待 VBUS 或角色转换时，可能尚未 取得 USB gate，却仍保留旧域 deadline，必须先 close/cancel 并完成排空。ClockDomain 只证明调用者实际登记并排空的借用，不发现遗漏 owner，也不替调用者暂停任务或 OS。"
msgstr "The complete Platform must successfully suspend before entering the raw Power API. Reading a peripheral gate as zero does not prove that logical borrowers drained. For example, OTG waiting for VBUS or a role transition while OFF may not yet own a USB gate but still retain an old-domain deadline; it must first close/cancel and complete drain. ClockDomain proves only the loans actually enrolled and drained by its caller. It neither discovers omitted owners nor suspends tasks or the OS on their behalf."

msgid ""
"Standby 的 WKUP／RTC 序列遵循 ES0182 Rev19 §2.2.6，以及新料号勘误 §2.2.4。 `wake_pins = "
"NX_STM32_WAKE_PIN_PA0` 显式选入 PA0；仅 F446 另外接受 "
"`NX_STM32_WAKE_PIN_PC13`。入口在所有源禁用时清 WUF，再重开所选 EWUP；返回时 恢复原 enable bits。已有"
" WUF 默认 BUSY，只有 `discard_wakeup = true` 才授权 确认它；F479 的保留 RTC-Standby "
"状态另有下述复位限制。WKUP 不要求额外 NVIC IRQ；调用者拥有所有已使能源、引脚和电气条件。PA0 Standby 电压不得套用 RUN"
" 的 5 V 容忍假设；软件参考要求输入不超过 VDD，实际电路与 VBAT 由产品验收。"
msgstr ""
"The Standby WKUP/RTC sequence follows ES0182 Rev19 §2.2.6 and §2.2.4 of "
"the new parts' errata. `wake_pins = NX_STM32_WAKE_PIN_PA0` explicitly "
"selects PA0; only F446 additionally accepts `NX_STM32_WAKE_PIN_PC13`. "
"Entry clears WUF while all sources are disabled, then reenables the "
"selected EWUP; a return restores the original enable bits. Existing WUF "
"produces BUSY by default; only `discard_wakeup = true` authorizes its "
"acknowledgment. Retained RTC-Standby state on F479 has the additional "
"reset restrictions below. WKUP requires no additional NVIC IRQ; the "
"caller owns all enabled sources, pins and electrical conditions. The RUN "
"assumption of 5 V tolerance must not be applied to PA0 Standby voltage; "
"the software reference requires the input not to exceed VDD, and the "
"product must qualify the actual circuit and VBAT."

msgid ""
"RTCEN 已开启的 Standby 使用 `nx_stm32_standby_enter()`。应用在 Platform.suspend "
"后先调用同一 RTC owner 的 `standby_prepare`，显式提供允许 丢弃的 RTC 事件 mask。RTC "
"独占前端禁源、必要的 flags/EXTI PR 确认及 receipt； Power 只读 validate，在 CWUF 后调用 "
"commit，再执行 WFI，不直接写 RTC/EXTI。 真正 Standby 复位不返回。虚假返回先重建 System epoch，再 "
"restore RTC；新到的 WUTF／EXTI PR 保持可消费。RTC restore 失败保留原 receipt，调用者重试后才能 "
"Platform.resume。PROVISION 的自主备份责任仍须显式 handoff，不能靠普通 close 或一次睡眠删除。"
msgstr ""
"Standby with RTCEN already enabled uses `nx_stm32_standby_enter()`. After"
" Platform.suspend, the application first calls `standby_prepare` on the "
"same RTC owner, explicitly supplying the mask of RTC events that may be "
"discarded. The RTC exclusively owns front-end source disabling, the "
"required flags/EXTI PR acknowledgments and the receipt; Power performs "
"read-only validate, calls commit after CWUF, then executes WFI, without "
"writing RTC/EXTI directly. A real Standby reset does not return. A "
"spurious return first establishes a new System epoch, then restores the "
"RTC; newly arrived WUTF/EXTI PR remain available for consumption. An RTC "
"restore failure retains the original receipt, and the caller must retry "
"successfully before Platform.resume. PROVISION's autonomous backup "
"responsibility still requires an explicit handoff and cannot be removed "
"by an ordinary close or a single sleep."

msgid "本 drained profile 只允许 EXTI0–15 与独立 RTC 的 IRQ 唤醒。RTC 的 EXTI17/21/22 EMR+RTSR 可通过 `wake_events` 选择一次 WFE；不使用会合并并丢弃 真实边沿的 SEV/WFE/WFE 清空序列。已有 event latch 可以造成立即返回，调用者仍 须重检业务谓词。RTC 必须有仍运行的 LSE/LSI，HSE 派生 RTC 不能充当此 STOP 唤醒。 不清 RTC/EXTI pending，不自动配置 Board wake pin。"
msgstr "This drained profile allows wake IRQs from EXTI0–15 and the independent RTC only. RTC EXTI17/21/22 EMR+RTSR can select one WFE through `wake_events`. It does not use a SEV/WFE/WFE clearing sequence that would coalesce and discard real edges. An existing event latch may return immediately; the caller must still recheck its business predicate. RTC requires LSE/LSI to remain running. HSE-derived RTC cannot supply this STOP wake. RTC/EXTI pending flags are not cleared and Board wake pins are not configured automatically."

msgid "进入前记录旧 TIM2 时间，停止 timer/vector 并结束旧 epoch；WFI/WFE 返回后在 PRIMASK 保护下恢复已选 PLL/总线/Flash，重新建立 1 MHz TIM2 并递增 `time_epoch`。收据分开提供 `old_epoch/before_us` 与 `new_epoch/after_us`。 Core 暂停的时间始终未知，不把 timer 归零包装成连续单调时间。恢复失败不返回到 旧 IRQ/deadline 消费者：保留 mask、资源与 storage，观测平台故障并 park。"
msgstr "Before entry, the mechanism records old TIM2 time, stops the timer/vector and ends the old epoch. After WFI/WFE returns, it restores the selected PLL, buses and Flash under PRIMASK, reestablishes 1 MHz TIM2 and increments `time_epoch`. The receipt separately reports `old_epoch/before_us` and `new_epoch/after_us`. Elapsed time while Core is paused remains unknown; resetting the timer does not create continuous monotonic time. Failed restoration never returns to old IRQ/deadline consumers: masks, resources and storage remain retained while the platform observes the fault and parks."

msgid ""
"`nx_stm32_deadline_bridge` 只接受匹配的旧 epoch，以及由独立 RTC 提供的 elapsed "
"min/max，输出新域中最早／最晚 deadline 包络。采样窗口、晶振误差、RTC 失效和量化误差必须计入外部界限。它不自动补 kernel"
" tick、恢复请求或重新启动任务。 Standby 必须已有明确 wake source；真实进入后通过复位重建整个 boot。若 WFI "
"立即返回，机制恢复新 RUN epoch 并报告 IO，不假称已经发生复位。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_stm32_deadline_bridge` accepts only a matching old epoch and elapsed "
"min/max supplied by an independent RTC, and outputs an earliest/latest "
"deadline envelope in the new domain. Sampling windows, crystal error, RTC"
" failure and quantization error must be included in the external bounds. "
"It does not automatically compensate kernel ticks, restore requests or "
"restart tasks. Standby must already have an explicit wake source; a real "
"entry rebuilds the entire boot through reset. If WFI returns immediately,"
" the mechanism restores a new RUN epoch and reports IO, without claiming "
"that a reset occurred."

msgid "F411／F446／F479 的低功耗范围"
msgstr "Low-power scope for F411/F446/F479"

msgid ""
"公共入口为 `nexus/soc/stm32f4_power.h`，沿用同一 C 启停与收据算法；器件差异只在 私有编译期 "
"traits。`wake_irqs[4]` 配合重排的 options 仍占 28 B，不建立运行期 型号分派、动态对象或第二个时钟 "
"owner。普通消费者持有 opaque ClockDomain； 可信集成通过公开 `clock_domain_owner.h` "
"显式提供原有静态存储。"
msgstr ""
"The public entry point is `nexus/soc/stm32f4_power.h`, reusing the same C"
" start/stop and receipt algorithms; device differences are confined to "
"private compile-time traits. The reordered options, including "
"`wake_irqs[4]`, still occupy 28 B, without runtime model dispatch, "
"dynamic objects or a second clock owner. Ordinary consumers hold an "
"opaque ClockDomain; trusted integration explicitly supplies the existing "
"static storage through the public `clock_domain_owner.h`."

msgid "精确器件"
msgstr "Exact device"

msgid "外部 IRQ 数／NVIC words"
msgstr "External IRQ count/NVIC words"

msgid "CCM／Backup SRAM"
msgstr "CCM/Backup SRAM"

msgid "Standby pin"
msgstr "Standby pin"

msgid "86／3"
msgstr "86／3"

msgid "无／无；保留 20 个备份寄存器"
msgstr "None/none; 20 backup registers retained"

msgid "PA0，EWUP bit8"
msgstr "PA0, EWUP bit8"

msgid "97／4"
msgstr "97／4"

msgid "无／4 KiB"
msgstr "None/4 KiB"

msgid "PA0→EWUP1 bit8；PC13→EWUP2 bit7"
msgstr "PA0→EWUP1 bit8; PC13→EWUP2 bit7"

msgid "93／3"
msgstr "93／3"

msgid "64 KiB／4 KiB"
msgstr "64 KiB／4 KiB"

msgid ""
"不存在的 IRQ words／bits 返回 INVALID；额外已使能或 active IRQ、运行中 DMA 和 未撤回 gate 返回 "
"BUSY。新料号的 FPDS、低压／underdrive、overdrive、F411／F446 的 FISSR／FMSSR "
"等外来电源模式不被继承。所选 STOP／Standby debug 位开启时 拒绝进入；未提供 WFE/NOP/BX 的独立 debug "
"workaround。普通运行与无低功耗 debug 位的调试连接不因此被禁止。"
msgstr ""
"Nonexistent IRQ words/bits return INVALID; additional enabled or active "
"IRQs, running DMA and gates not withdrawn return BUSY. Foreign power "
"modes on the new parts, including FPDS, low-voltage/underdrive, overdrive"
" and F411/F446 FISSR/FMSSR, are not inherited. Entry is rejected when the"
" selected STOP/Standby debug bits are enabled; no separate WFE/NOP/BX "
"debug workaround is provided. Ordinary operation and a debug connection "
"without low-power debug bits are not thereby prohibited."

msgid ""
"F446ZE LQFP 的 PC13 transitions 会干扰晶体 LSE，所选或预使能的 PC13 wake 与 live crystal"
" LSE 冲突时均拒绝；不自动换源。普通 CSR 控制写入还将 F446／F479 的 `UDRDY[19:18]` 写值置零，保留其 rc_w1"
" 历史状态；同一规则用于 RTC backup regulator 的 BRE 控制，不把无关标志读改写为确认。"
msgstr ""
"PC13 transitions on F446ZE LQFP interfere with crystal LSE; both selected"
" and previously enabled PC13 wake are rejected when they conflict with a "
"live crystal LSE, and no source is substituted automatically. Ordinary "
"CSR control writes also set the written value of F446/F479 `UDRDY[19:18]`"
" to zero, preserving their historical rc_w1 state; the same rule applies "
"to BRE control of the RTC backup regulator, without turning a read-"
"modify-write of unrelated flags into an acknowledgment."

msgid ""
"首批 RTC 配置只接纳上表精确器件、baremetal、已集成验证的高速 RUN tuple： F411 M16/N384/P4/Q8，F446"
" M16/N336/P2/Q7，F479 M10/N210/P2/Q7；AHB 除1， APB 与前述 RUN 表一致，ADC 除4、声明 3.3"
" V、CSS 关闭、无 PLLSAI。Board 必须 显式声明 LSE32768 晶体。`adopt-retained` 与 "
"`provision-empty` 仍分别要求既有 保留数据来源和明确初始日期；没有隐式清空备份域。F411 的 SRAM 操作为 "
"UNSUPPORTED， 不由公共 PWR.BRE 宏推断 SRAM。第二 tamper route、LSE bypass、duration "
"wakeup、 直接 HSI16 的 RTC 组合与 RTOS 深睡眠尚未授予本切片。"
msgstr ""
"The initial RTC configurations admit only the exact devices in the table "
"above, baremetal and the high-speed RUN tuples already validated in "
"integration: F411 M16/N384/P4/Q8, F446 M16/N336/P2/Q7 and F479 "
"M10/N210/P2/Q7; AHB divided by 1, APB as in the preceding RUN table, ADC "
"divided by 4, a declared 3.3 V supply, CSS disabled and no PLLSAI. The "
"Board must explicitly declare an LSE32768 crystal. `adopt-retained` and "
"`provision-empty` still require, respectively, provenance for existing "
"retained data and an explicit initial date; the backup domain is never "
"implicitly cleared. F411 SRAM operations return UNSUPPORTED; SRAM is not "
"inferred from the public PWR.BRE macro. A second tamper route, LSE "
"bypass, duration wakeup, the direct-HSI16 RTC combination and RTOS deep "
"sleep have not been authorized for this slice."

msgid ""
"RTC 的 BYPSHAD 读取、RSF／INIT 交接、DBP 即时读回与独立事件 receipt 复用真实 C 实现。主机回归覆盖新料号的 "
"Power admission、失败恢复以及 RTC/System/Platform 共同路径。独立软件消费者见 [F4 Power "
"参考](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_power/README.md)。 软件构建不证明 LSE "
"精度、唤醒延迟、实际低功耗、VDD/VBAT 保留或复位行为。"
msgstr ""
"RTC BYPSHAD reads, RSF/INIT handoff, immediate DBP readback and "
"independent event receipts reuse the actual C implementation. Host "
"regressions cover Power admission, failure recovery and the shared "
"RTC/System/Platform paths for the new parts. For the independent software"
" consumers, see the [F4 Power reference](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_power/README.md). Software builds do not "
"prove LSE accuracy, wake latency, actual low-power consumption, VDD/VBAT "
"retention or reset behavior."

msgid ""
"F479 的 ES0321 §2.2.13 要求 RTC Standby 唤醒后先清 SBF、再系统复位，才能可靠 再次进入 RTC "
"Standby。`nx_stm32_power_wake_status()` 只观察保留标志，不确认或 推断具体唤醒原因；RTC rearm 遇到"
" SBF 或 WUF 时保守拒绝。产品先保存和评估业务 原因，明确授权后可调用 "
"`nx_stm32_power_standby_reset_prepare()`，再执行自己的 系统复位。该函数只清 SBF，并有界读回；不清 "
"WUF／RTC／备份数据，也不发起复位。 SUCCESS 不能替代随后的复位，不能用 `discard_wakeup` 绕过。WKUP-only "
"Standby 是独立入口范围，仍须遵守自身唤醒和电气约束。"
msgstr ""
"F479 ES0321 §2.2.13 requires clearing SBF and then performing a system "
"reset after an RTC Standby wake before RTC Standby can be reentered "
"reliably. `nx_stm32_power_wake_status()` only observes retained flags; it"
" does not acknowledge them or infer a specific wake cause. RTC rearm "
"conservatively rejects SBF or WUF. The product first saves and evaluates "
"its business-level causes, and, after explicit authorization, may call "
"`nx_stm32_power_standby_reset_prepare()` before performing its own system"
" reset. This function only clears SBF and performs bounded readback; it "
"does not clear WUF/RTC/backup data or initiate a reset. SUCCESS does not "
"replace the subsequent reset, and `discard_wakeup` cannot bypass it. "
"WKUP-only Standby is a separate entry scope and must still comply with "
"its own wake and electrical constraints."

msgid "EWI、CSS、故障与 trace"
msgstr "EWI, CSS, faults and trace"

msgid "WWDG 的基本 owner 仍为原有 6-byte 状态。可选 caller-owned `nx_stm32f407_wwdg_ewi_t` 在显式激活看门狗之后 arm，产品提供唯一 WWDG vector。 EWI 是 sticky 效果，失败读回或 NVIC enable 不能撤回 storage；IRQ 精确清 EWIF， 累计饱和次数并报告 overflow，不喂狗、不复位、不调用 worker。早／迟喂狗窗口继续 由原 owner 核对真实 counter；EWI 开启后 feed 保留 EWI 配置。"
msgstr "The existing base WWDG owner remains a 6-byte state. Optional caller-owned `nx_stm32f407_wwdg_ewi_t` arms after explicit watchdog activation; the product supplies the unique WWDG vector. EWI is a sticky effect: failed readback or NVIC enable cannot release its storage. IRQ acknowledges exactly EWIF, increments a saturating count and reports overflow; it never feeds, resets or calls a worker. The original owner still checks the actual counter for early/late feed windows. Feeding preserves EWI configuration after EWI is enabled."

msgid "`css = true` 只用于 HSE，显式选择 NMI ownership。CSS/NMI 在确认任何 elapsed 时间之前标记 TIM2 域失败，确认 CSSC 时保留其他 RCC interrupt enable，再保留 全部效果、观测并 park。它不采用降频后继续使用旧 deadline 的恢复策略。"
msgstr "`css = true` applies only to HSE and explicitly selects NMI ownership. CSS/NMI marks the TIM2 domain failed before acknowledging any elapsed time, preserves other RCC interrupt enables while acknowledging CSSC, then retains all effects, observes the fault and parks. It does not reduce frequency and continue using old deadlines."

msgid "`nx_stm32f407_fault_capture` 使用调用者静态记录及 lock-free 首次发布；嵌套报告 不能覆盖首故障，完整 acquire/read 与 checksum 拒绝未完成或损坏记录。接口不沿 不可信 SP 走栈；fault entry 先根据 EXC_RETURN、FPU extended frame 与 stacking 错误证明 basic frame 可读。默认不预留 RAM、不装载产品 Fault vector、不写 Flash。"
msgstr "`nx_stm32f407_fault_capture` uses caller-owned static records and lock-free first publication. Nested reports cannot overwrite the first fault; complete acquire/read and checksum reject incomplete or corrupted records. The API does not walk an untrusted SP. Fault entry first proves the basic frame readable from EXC_RETURN, the FPU extended frame and stacking errors. The default reserves no RAM, installs no product Fault vector and writes no Flash."

msgid "复位原因仍是启动捕获的原始 flags 映射。显式 clear 只执行硬件支持的完整 RMVF 确认，不篡改已捕获 cause；显式 reset request 保留 PRIGROUP、提供 AIRCR key， 保存 mask 并等待真实复位。DWT trace 由显式调用开启／关闭，关闭不清共享 TRCENA； 周期计数在 STOP 停止，速率随 HCLK，既不是时间域，也不是一个永久 deadline。"
msgstr "Reset causes remain a mapping of raw flags captured at startup. Explicit clear performs only the hardware-supported whole RMVF acknowledgement without changing the captured cause. Explicit reset request preserves PRIGROUP, supplies the AIRCR key, saves masks and waits for real reset. DWT trace is explicitly enabled/disabled; disable does not clear shared TRCENA. Cycle counting stops during STOP and changes rate with HCLK. It is neither a time domain nor a permanent deadline."

msgid "RNG 的 typed 配置与时钟依赖"
msgstr "Typed RNG configuration and clock dependencies"

msgid "通过 `[entropy.random]`、`binding = \"rng\"`、`mode = \"rng-words\"` 选择唯一 RNG 内部路线。四个生产 Board 包都声明该无引脚 binding；它不建立外部电路或 熵质量资格。配置期只消费已解析计划的 `pll48.nominal_hz`，缺少精确 48 MHz 时 拒绝生成。`nx_factory_entropy(NX_ENTROPY_ID_RANDOM)` 只返回既有 readonly face，不启动硬件。生成的 Platform 生命周期直接使用原有私有 C owner 与 ops， 没有第二份实例或时钟 authority；未选择时不编译 RNG driver。"
msgstr "Select the unique internal RNG route with `[entropy.random]`, `binding = \"rng\"` and `mode = \"rng-words\"`. All four production Board packages declare that pinless binding. It establishes no external circuit or entropy-quality qualification. Configuration consumes only the resolved plan's `pll48.nominal_hz` and rejects generation without exact 48 MHz. `nx_factory_entropy(NX_ENTROPY_ID_RANDOM)` returns the existing read-only face without starting hardware. Generated Platform lifecycle uses the existing private C owner and operations table directly, with no second instance or clock authority. Unselected assemblies do not compile the RNG driver."

msgid "Platform 在 System 成功启动后 prepare RNG，并在关闭或挂起时撤回 RNG enable 与本 owner 取得的 gate；恢复仍使用同一静态 owner，并重新绑定当前 time epoch。 在任何 System 时钟效果前先只读拒绝已有 gate 下的外部 RNGEN／IE；prepare 再次检查 System 运行状态、RCC/Flash 完整计划与实际 PLL48，不修改共享 PLL。 HSE26、HSI 与直接 SYSCLK 共用同一事实；直接输入必须显式预留 `pll48 = true`。"
msgstr "Platform prepares RNG after System successfully starts and withdraws RNG enable and this owner's acquired gate on stop or suspend. Resume reuses the same static owner and binds the current time epoch again. Read-only admission rejects foreign RNGEN/IE under an already enabled gate before any System clock effect. Prepare then checks System running state, the full RCC/Flash plan and actual PLL48 without changing the shared PLL. HSE26, HSI and direct SYSCLK use the same facts; direct input requires an explicit `pll48 = true` reservation."

msgid "每次读保留官方 RNG 的首字丢弃、连续相同值与 seed/clock 错误检查；失去时钟或 epoch 后不再发布数据，不建立熵池或质量认证。应用在 Platform suspend／stop 之前 join 全部同步 RNG／TLS／网络消费者。关闭失败保留原 owner、时钟依赖与可 重试责任；时钟失败后仍可清理，成功才撤回本 owner 取得的位。外部活动 RNGEN／IRQ 仍会令 System.stop 在任何写入之前拒绝撤时钟。"
msgstr "Each read retains the official RNG's first-word discard, continuous equal-value check and seed/clock error checks. Data is not published after clock or epoch loss; no entropy pool or quality certification is established. Applications join all synchronous RNG/TLS/network consumers before Platform suspend/stop. Failed shutdown retains the original owner, clock dependency and retry responsibility. Cleanup remains available after clock failure and releases only the bits acquired by this owner on success. Foreign active RNGEN/IRQ still causes System.stop to reject clock withdrawal before any write."
